EchoLens release v0.1.0.
Original project code and EchoLens model modifications are offered under
Apache-2.0, subject to the retained third-party notices and licenses below.

The extraction adapter modifies Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B (Alibaba Cloud, Apache-2.0).
The aspect classifier fine-tunes hfl/chinese-roberta-wwm-ext
(Chinese-BERT-wwm contributors, Apache-2.0).
Training/evaluation uses the ASAP dataset from Meituan-Dianping, whose
repository includes an Apache-2.0 license. The EchoLens opinion annotations
are AI-assisted derived labels, not the original ASAP annotation task.
Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B is loaded separately for topic embeddings.

